<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1382359170"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538261364"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Torches"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Aimer"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Torches"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:27.545"><div begin="00:22.625" end="04:27.685"><p begin="00:22.625" end="00:27.539" itunes:key="L26163">It's just like a burning torch in the storm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就宛如风暴中熊熊燃烧的火炬</span></p><p begin="00:28.883" end="00:33.512" itunes:key="L26164">Like a little flower blooming in the home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如屋檐下娇艳绽放的小花</span></p><p begin="00:34.521" end="00:39.531" itunes:key="L26165">強く確かな意思を掲げ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心怀顽强坚定的意志</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku ta shi ka na i shi wo ka ka ge</span></p><p begin="00:40.452" end="00:45.129" itunes:key="L26166">時に優しくあればいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶尔也会流露一丝柔情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ni ya sa shi ku a re ba i i</span></p><p begin="00:46.272" end="00:51.386" itunes:key="L26167">A misty moon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这朦胧的月色下</span></p><p begin="00:52.140" end="00:57.536" itunes:key="L26168">I'm missing you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我思念着你</span></p><p begin="00:58.163" end="01:03.103" itunes:key="L26169">滲む景色に膝を抱き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旧景逐渐淡去 抱紧双膝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ji mu ke shi ki ni hi za wo da ki</span></p><p begin="01:04.038" end="01:06.827" itunes:key="L26170">胸をはせる時<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉浸思念之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne wo ha se ru to ki</span></p><p begin="01:06.901" end="01:09.083" itunes:key="L26171">Listen to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听我说</span></p><p begin="01:09.093" end="01:12.597" itunes:key="L26172">Cleave your way again, again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次披荆斩棘开拓你的道路吧</span></p><p begin="01:12.607" end="01:18.618" itunes:key="L26173">誓いの日々が最後に放つ未来<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">誓言的日子便是那最后绽放的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ka i no hi bi ga sa i go ni ha na tsu mi ra i</span></p><p begin="01:18.637" end="01:24.173" itunes:key="L26174">ゆがんだ空に描いた掌たちが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾在扭曲天空中描画梦想的无数掌心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ga n da so ra ni e ga i ta te no hi ra ta chi ga</span></p><p begin="01:24.183" end="01:26.038" itunes:key="L26175">頬を濡らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却让泪湿了脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho wo nu ra su</span></p><p begin="01:26.337" end="01:28.466" itunes:key="L26176">You're not alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不是孤身一人</span></p><p begin="01:28.476" end="01:34.647" itunes:key="L26177">今 灯火を抱け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 拥抱灯火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma to mo shi bi wo da ke</span></p><p begin="01:35.044" end="01:40.632" itunes:key="L26178">その闇にむけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着黑暗航行吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ya mi ni mu ke</span></p><p begin="01:53.440" end="01:58.462" itunes:key="L26179">It's just like a lighthouse in your hands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就宛如你手中的灯塔</span></p><p begin="01:59.602" end="02:04.505" itunes:key="L26180">Like a little flag flapping in the sands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如砂砾中飘扬的旌旗</span></p><p begin="02:05.270" end="02:10.219" itunes:key="L26181">ふいに失くした意味に怯え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">畏惧着会突然失去意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i ni na ku shi ta i mi ni o bi e</span></p><p begin="02:11.062" end="02:16.165" itunes:key="L26182">道を誤ることはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却也从来未曾走错道路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi wo a ya ma ru ko to wa na i</span></p><p begin="02:17.003" end="02:22.336" itunes:key="L26183">A floating moon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这飘渺的月色下</span></p><p begin="02:22.826" end="02:28.103" itunes:key="L26184">You still croon?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你仍在低声吟唱吗</span></p><p begin="02:28.901" end="02:33.836" itunes:key="L26185">揺れる波間に目を凝らし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凝望着汹涌的波涛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu re ru na mi ma ni me wo ko ra shi</span></p><p begin="02:34.747" end="02:37.577" itunes:key="L26186">舵を止める時<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">停下船舵之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ji wo to me ru to ki</span></p><p begin="02:37.631" end="02:39.850" itunes:key="L26187">Listen to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听我说</span></p><p begin="02:39.860" end="02:43.276" itunes:key="L26188">Sail away again, again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次扬帆远航吧</span></p><p begin="02:43.286" end="02:49.315" itunes:key="L26189">未開の海に 海路を照らす願い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿望照亮了尚未开拓的海上航路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ka i no u mi ni ka i ro wo te ra su ne ga i</span></p><p begin="02:49.357" end="02:52.236" itunes:key="L26190">繋いだ声は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相连的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na i da ko e wa</span></p><p begin="02:52.251" end="02:56.764" itunes:key="L26191">答えのない世界へと 帆を揺らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着没有答案的世界扬起风帆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e no na i se ka i he to ho wo yu ra su</span></p><p begin="02:57.052" end="02:59.245" itunes:key="L26192">You're not alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不是孤身一人</span></p><p begin="02:59.255" end="03:05.372" itunes:key="L26193">ただ 荒波を行け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需破浪前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da a ra na mi wo i ke</span></p><p begin="03:05.793" end="03:11.290" itunes:key="L26194">その闇を抜け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冲破眼前的黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ya mi wo nu ke</span></p><p begin="03:23.371" end="03:26.201" itunes:key="L26195">輝きを増せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破晓之光愈加明亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ga ya ki wo ma se</span></p><p begin="03:26.205" end="03:31.860" itunes:key="L26196">吹き荒れる風が織りなす雨音は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼啸的狂风编织而成的雨声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ki a re ru ka ze ga o ri na su a ma o to wa</span></p><p begin="03:32.162" end="03:37.520" itunes:key="L26197">遥か遠く見えた大地の唄になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化作远方大地所吟唱的歌谣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ru ka to o ku mi e ta da i chi no u ta ni na ru</span></p><p begin="03:37.591" end="03:43.116" itunes:key="L26198">黄金色に輝く瞼の景色と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了眼中闪耀着金色光芒的景象</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ga ne i ro ni ka ga ya ku ma bu ta no ke shi ki to</span></p><p begin="03:43.138" end="03:49.457" itunes:key="L26199">やがて来る祝福の日々のため<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以及终将来临的祝福之日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ga te ku ru shu ku fu ku no hi bi no ta me</span></p><p begin="03:49.737" end="03:55.278" itunes:key="L26200">傷つかずに進むだけの道などなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前行之路 我们无法远离伤痛永远顺遂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu ka zu ni su su mu da ke no mi chi na do na ku</span></p><p begin="03:55.600" end="04:01.023" itunes:key="L26201">傷つくためだけに生まれた者もない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但无论是谁 都绝不是仅为承受伤痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu ku ta me da ke ni</span></p><p begin="04:01.133" end="04:03.924" itunes:key="L26202">Do good to be good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">行正义之事 做正义之人</span></p><p begin="04:03.981" end="04:08.306" itunes:key="L26203">Do good to be good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">行正义之事 做正义之人</span></p><p begin="04:08.727" end="04:10.213" itunes:key="L26204">You're not alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不是孤身一人</span></p><p begin="04:10.223" end="04:15.651" itunes:key="L26205">荒波を行け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破浪前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra na mi wo i ke</span></p><p begin="04:16.022" end="04:21.485" itunes:key="L26206">その闇を抜け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冲破眼前的黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ya mi wo nu ke</span></p><p begin="04:21.880" end="04:27.685" itunes:key="L26207">ただ前を向け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一心向前继续航行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da ma e wo mu ke</span></p></div></body></tt>